{"id":"n14864-1-8","stage":2,"title":"갈증 · 干渴","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n14864-1-8-1","ko":"점심을 짜게 먹었더니 목이 자꾸 마르네.","zh":"我中午吃了太咸的东西，所以一直觉得口渴。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"점심을","meaning":"中午","explanation":"점심：中午；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"점심","audio":"/audio/12cf30d1ce4feda7a77d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70868","senseId":"2","lemma":"점심","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"짜게","meaning":"咸","explanation":"짜다：咸；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"짜다","audio":"/audio/2a62c1820e5f4c49c8d9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71578","senseId":"1","lemma":"짜다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"먹었더니","meaning":"吃","explanation":"먹다：吃；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；더니：根据先前观察的情况，引出后来的变化、结果或对比。","readings":[{"term":"먹다","audio":"/audio/9639f892bdddb53fc055.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58272","senseId":"1","lemma":"먹다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"목이","meaning":"喉咙，嗓子，咽喉","explanation":"목：喉咙，嗓子，咽喉；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"목","audio":"/audio/5fbc9add7bd4911bb918.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89861","senseId":"2","lemma":"목","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"자꾸","meaning":"一直，总是","explanation":"자꾸：一直，总是","readings":[{"term":"자꾸","audio":"/audio/d28ff63a0382ce4fce6d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70796","senseId":"1","lemma":"자꾸","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"마르네.","meaning":"渴，口干","explanation":"마르다：渴，口干；네：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"마르다","audio":"/audio/6cd2f7184df80453aa2c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64677","senseId":"4","lemma":"마르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"12cf30d1ce4feda7","term":"점심","zh":"中午","audio":"/audio/12cf30d1ce4feda7a77d.mp3","entryId":"70868","definition":"一天中太阳在最高位置的，早上和晚上中间的时间。","pronunciation":["점ː심"]},{"id":"2a62c1820e5f4c49","term":"짜다","zh":"咸","audio":"/audio/2a62c1820e5f4c49c8d9.mp3","entryId":"71578","definition":"味道和盐一样。","pronunciation":["짜다"]},{"id":"9639f892bdddb53f","term":"먹다","zh":"吃","audio":"/audio/9639f892bdddb53fc055.mp3","entryId":"58272","definition":"将食物送进口中并咽下。","pronunciation":["먹따"]},{"id":"5fbc9add7bd4911b","term":"목","zh":"喉咙，嗓子，咽喉","audio":"/audio/5fbc9add7bd4911bb918.mp3","entryId":"89861","definition":"在脖子内部通向体内的深深的洞。","pronunciation":["목"]},{"id":"d28ff63a0382ce4f","term":"자꾸","zh":"一直，总是","audio":"/audio/d28ff63a0382ce4fce6d.mp3","entryId":"70796","definition":"多次连续地。","pronunciation":["자꾸"]},{"id":"6cd2f7184df80453","term":"마르다","zh":"渴，口干","audio":"/audio/6cd2f7184df80453aa2c.mp3","entryId":"64677","definition":"嘴里或嗓子里唾液变少因而想喝水。","pronunciation":["마르다"]}],"audio":"/audio/8014836ea662cf3c122f.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n14864-1-8-2","ko":"물을 마시면 갈증이 없어질 거야.","zh":"喝点水的话，口渴的感觉就会消失的。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"물을","meaning":"水","explanation":"물：水；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"물","audio":"/audio/2e7edc957ce601f5ff7c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17596","senseId":"1","lemma":"물","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"마시면","meaning":"喝，饮","explanation":"마시다：喝，饮；면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"마시다","audio":"/audio/dbfc687cbb29318d3ccd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64682","senseId":"1","lemma":"마시다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"갈증이","meaning":"干渴，口渴","explanation":"갈증：干渴，口渴；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"갈증","audio":"/audio/905165ff46ae43a8f9ed.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14864","senseId":"1","lemma":"갈증","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"없어질","meaning":"没有；表示成为前面表达的状态。","explanation":"없다：没有；지다：表示成为前面表达的状态。；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"없다","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3"},{"term":"지다","audio":"/audio/6fde84679c7f2c315bb0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89917","senseId":"3","lemma":"없다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"77247","senseId":"3","lemma":"지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"거야.","meaning":"表示说话人的确信、决定、决心等。","explanation":"거：表示说话人的确信、决定、决心等。；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"4","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"2e7edc957ce601f5","term":"물","zh":"水","audio":"/audio/2e7edc957ce601f5ff7c.mp3","entryId":"17596","definition":"含在河、湖、海、地下水等，纯粹的且无色无香无味的透明液体。","pronunciation":["물"]},{"id":"dbfc687cbb29318d","term":"마시다","zh":"喝，饮","audio":"/audio/dbfc687cbb29318d3ccd.mp3","entryId":"64682","definition":"使水等液体流入喉咙。","pronunciation":["마시다"]},{"id":"905165ff46ae43a8","term":"갈증","zh":"干渴，口渴","audio":"/audio/905165ff46ae43a8f9ed.mp3","entryId":"14864","definition":"嗓子干、想喝水的感觉。","pronunciation":["갈쯩"]},{"id":"815560dcd5b82893","term":"없다","zh":"没有","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3","entryId":"89917","definition":"不发生某个事情或症状。","pronunciation":["업ː따"]},{"id":"6fde84679c7f2c31","term":"지다","zh":"表示成为前面表达的状态。","audio":"/audio/6fde84679c7f2c315bb0.mp3","entryId":"77247","definition":"表示成为前面表达的状态。","pronunciation":["지다"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"表示说话人的确信、决定、决心等。","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"表示说话人的确信、决定、决心等。","pronunciation":["거"]}],"audio":"/audio/df6dab5002a60bff8468.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.648,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=14864","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":83,"sequenceScore":2.3014,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["喝点水的话，口渴的感觉就会消失的。","我中午吃了太咸的东西，所以一直觉得口渴。","明天晚上大家应该都没什么事吧？好久没聚了，一起去吃顿饭吧。"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["我中午吃了太咸的东西，所以一直觉得口渴。","明天晚上大家应该都没什么事吧？好久没聚了，一起去吃顿饭吧。","喝点水的话，口渴的感觉就会消失的。"],"answer":2}]}
